USE CASE 1 : PYTHON MICROSERVICE

1. I want to create a python microservice using Fast API and openai with RAG [document search]
2.  User flow
     a. If User enters the prompt if the prompt do no include any words related to ticket , incident , issue , the service MUST return reply to prompt    
	   based on the documents shared in .pdf, .doc, .docx, .txt or any human redable format.. using Langchain-openai
	   
	 b. If user enters a prompt that contains keywords such as issue, incident, ticket then service should ask user whether he wants to create an incident/ticket/issue, if user says yes then should trigger a seperate chain wherein service MUST be able to call  collect the user inputs [user name , useremail address ] along with the screenshots and network logs and call gitlab api /issues & /uploads to attach and create issue in GITLAB


