To create a Python microservice using FastAPI, OpenAI with RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation), and integrate it with GitLab for issue creation, follow the steps below. This implementation will also include saving issue details to a PostgreSQL database and adhering to best practices for microservices, including Dockerization and environment variable management.

